From: grimtickle-overlay (local)
Subject: [PATCH] drm: cix: port the display stack to the 7.2 atomic API

Linux 7.2 renamed `struct drm_atomic_state` to `struct drm_atomic_commit`
and `drm_atomic_state_put()` to `drm_atomic_commit_put()`, and made
drm_panel_init() static in favour of devm_drm_panel_alloc().  The CIX
linlon-dp/dptx driver still used the old names, so it did not build once
CONFIG_DRM_CIX was enabled.

- treewide: `struct drm_atomic_state` -> `struct drm_atomic_commit` and
  `drm_atomic_state_put()` -> `drm_atomic_commit_put()` (the
  drm_atomic_state_helper.h include and a few comments/log strings keep
  the historical name; they are not type references).
- cix_edp_panel_probe(): allocate and initialise the panel with
  devm_drm_panel_alloc() instead of devm_kzalloc() + drm_panel_init().

Every other 7.1->7.2 API change in this driver is already version-guarded
by the vendor (drm_panel_{prepare,enable,disable,unprepare} <6.16,
from_timer <6.16, del_timer <6.15, drm_dp_get_vc_payload_bw <6.14,
drm_fbdev_generic_setup <6.11/<6.13, .lastclose <6.12, .date <6.14), so
only the atomic rename and the panel allocation needed changing.
diff --git a/drivers/gpu/drm/cix/dptx/cix_edp_panel.c b/drivers/gpu/drm/cix/dptx/cix_edp_panel.c
index 1a9f8d1..a5e1161 100644
--- a/drivers/gpu/drm/cix/dptx/cix_edp_panel.c
+++ b/drivers/gpu/drm/cix/dptx/cix_edp_panel.c
@@ -628,9 +628,11 @@ static int cix_edp_panel_probe(struct device *dev, const struct panel_desc *desc
 
 	dev_info(dev, "%s, begin\n", __func__);
 
-	panel = devm_kzalloc(dev, sizeof(*panel), GFP_KERNEL);
-	if (!panel)
-		return -ENOMEM;
+	panel = devm_drm_panel_alloc(dev, struct cix_edp_panel, base,
+				     &cix_edp_panel_funcs,
+				     DRM_MODE_CONNECTOR_eDP);
+	if (IS_ERR(panel))
+		return PTR_ERR(panel);
 
 	panel->enabled = false;
 	panel->prepared = false;
@@ -690,9 +692,6 @@ static int cix_edp_panel_probe(struct device *dev, const struct panel_desc *desc
 	if (desc->bpc != 6 && desc->bpc != 8)
 		dev_warn(dev, "Expected bpc in {6,8} but got: %u\n", desc->bpc);
 
-	drm_panel_init(&panel->base, dev, &cix_edp_panel_funcs,
-		       DRM_MODE_CONNECTOR_eDP);
-
 	if (has_acpi_companion(dev)) {
 		err = drm_panel_acpi_backlight(&panel->base);
 	} else {
